# Private keys. Nothing here needs a Firebase/Google service account -- token
# verification uses public certificates -- so if one of these ever appears it is
# almost certainly a mistake, and it must not be committed.
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
secrets/
